              "instruction": "आप कद आवो हो? — āp kad āvo ho? — When do you come?",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **आप कद आवो हो?** — *āp kad āvo ho?* — When do you come?]"
